The '''incinerator room''' was the location in [[Cloud City]] where scrap and broken machinery was stored and ultimately destroyed in an incinerator located at the back of the room. After [[C-3PO]] was blasted apart when he discovered [[stormtrooper]]s were present on Cloud City, his remains were brought to the incinerator room. It was there that [[Chewbacca]] located the [[droid]] and recovered his parts to be reassembled.<ref name="TESB" />

